OL,3,GNEWSAHackers publish 320,000 school
OL,4,Afiles on dark web
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 320,000 files stolen in a
OL,7,Fcyber attack on a council's schools
OL,8,Fserver have been found on the dark web.
OL,10,FBristol City Council said the data was
OL,11,Fstolen from 39 of the schools that use
OL,12,Fits Trading with Schools platform,
OL,13,Fwhich was hacked in September.
OL,15,FHeadteachers have been informed about
OL,16,Fthe development and are issuing
OL,17,Fguidance to families at the affected
OL,18,Fschools.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,342,340,200,160,0,100
